      "1 <= T <= 100",
      "1 <= N <= 10^5"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "The first line contains an integer T, the number of test cases. Then T test cases follow. Each test case contains an integer N, the floor number.",
    "outputFormat": "For each test case, print the floor number.",
